      "id": "tpl_initial_001",
      "name": "Initial Outreach",
      "stage": "initial_outreach",
      "subject": "Elevate {{company}}'s Brand with Professional Design",
      "body": "<p>Hi {{name}},</p>\n<p>I hope this finds you well! I came across {{company}} and was genuinely impressed by what you're building.</p>\n<p>We run a design &amp; branding subscription that helps growing companies stand out — unlimited design requests, fast turnarounds, and a dedicated designer who understands your brand.</p>\n<p>Would you be open to a quick 15-minute chat to explore if there's a fit?</p>\n<p>Best,<br>{{sender}}</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "tpl_followup_002",
      "name": "Follow-Up",
      "stage": "follow_up",
      "subject": "Following up — Design for {{company}}",
      "body": "<p>Hi {{name}},</p>\n<p>Just circling back on my last message — I know inboxes get busy!</p>\n<p>We've helped companies similar to {{company}} transform their visual presence without the overhead of an in-house team. I'd love to share a few relevant examples.</p>\n<p>Even a quick 10 minutes could be worthwhile. What does your week look like?</p>\n<p>Best,<br>{{sender}}</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "tpl_proposal_003",
      "name": "Proposal Ready",
      "stage": "proposal",
      "subject": "Your Design Proposal — {{company}}",
      "body": "<p>Hi {{name}},</p>\n<p>Thank you for your interest! Here's what our subscription includes for {{company}}:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Unlimited design requests</li>\n<li>48-hour turnaround on most tasks</li>\n<li>Dedicated designer who knows your brand</li>\n<li>Unlimited revisions</li>\n</ul>\n<p>I'd love to walk you through the details on a quick call. When works best for you?</p>\n<p>Best,<br>{{sender}}</p>"
    },
