      "name": "Closing",
      "stage": "closing",
      "subject": "Ready to get started, {{name}}?",
      "body": "<p>Hi {{name}},</p>\n<p>One final follow-up — we have a limited offer this month I'd hate for {{company}} to miss.</p>\n<p>If the timing isn't right, no worries at all — I'll check back later. But if you'd like to move forward or have any questions, just reply here.</p>\n<p>Looking forward to hearing from you,<br>{{sender}}</p>"
